    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "M\nF\n•\n(/ UNITED",
      "N\nE\nWe are pleased to present an array of fine California wines\ncarefully selected for their excellence by United's Cellar Committee\nunder the guidance of wine judge and author; Bob Thompson.\nYour Flight Attendant will inform you which wines are being offered today:\nCHAMPAGNE\nDomaine Chandon Napa Valley Brut NV\nCHARDONNAY\nWilliam Wheeler\nVilla Mt. Eden\nSonoma County 1989 or Napa Valley 1989\nChâteau Souverain 1988\nCABERNET SAUVIGNON\nor\nLouis Martini Reserve 1987\nN\nG\nEnjoy a glass of chilled Orange Juice.\nor a hot cup of freshly brewed Coffee\nSara Lee Muffin and a Croissant\nwith Continental Butter and Preserves\n1400 a\nN\nURSE S\nFines Herbes Omelette\nblends fresh Eggs with a taste of Tarragon, Basil and Chives\nCanadian Bacon Scottish Banger Fresh Fruit\nCheese Blintzes\nare Crêpes filled with a light Cottage Cheese\nblended with Orange Zest and Cinnamon\nRaspberry Orange Sauce Canadian Bacon Fresh Fruit\nMay We Suggest\na light alternative of Cantaloupe, Honeydew Melon, Grapes\nand Strawberries, served with Yogurt and cold Cereal\nThe Finishing Touch\nwe recommend is 100% Colombian Coffee,\nCappuccino or selected Herbal Teas\nF O\nR\nU\nCalifornia Deli Buffet\nDesigned in consultation\nwith the renowned Nate 'n Al of Beverly Hills\nFeaturing an array of Smoked Salmon with traditional accompaniments,\nShrimp, Meats and Cheeses, assorted Breads\nand Bagels and a basket of seasonal fresh Fruit\nB01(J)-S01(J)\n11/92"
    ],
